#
# PREDICTION (write BEFORE assessing — the seal makes it non-retractable):
#   pipeline: Per-frame SOR (20 neighbors, std_ratio=3.0) masks isolated depth
#             points before voxelization; all 191 frames retained. RawPointCount
#             is measured on the derived capture, not the original capture.
#   baseline: Hypothesis: Mean L2 remains below 0.10 m, possibly lower than the
#             original 0.05883481 m; lost geometric support could instead worsen it.
#   treatment: Only per-frame depth masks change. voxel_size_m=0.05, seed=0,
#              Open3D point-to-plane ICP; RGB, GT and intrinsics unchanged.
#   provenance: Source eval/first_floor; derived capture batch.ttl records
#               prov:wasDerivedFrom floor1_first_floor. See analysis protocol.
# =============================================================================

